    "rendered": "ቅዱስ ጴጥሮስ ሆስፒታል ለድርጅታችን ህፃናትና ሰራተኞች የህክምና ድጋፍ አደረገ"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p><a href=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/4.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-1107\" src=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/4-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"163\" height=\"217\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/4-225x300.jpg 225w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/4-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/4-18x24.jpg 18w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/4-27x36.jpg 27w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/4-36x48.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/4.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 163px) 100vw, 163px\" /></a> <a href=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/5.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-1108 alignleft\" src=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/5-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"212\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/5-225x300.jpg 225w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/5-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/5-18x24.jpg 18w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/5-27x36.jpg 27w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/5-36x48.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/5.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 159px) 100vw, 159px\" /></a> <a href=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-1109 alignleft\" src=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"269\" height=\"202\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6-300x225.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6-768x576.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6-160x120.jpg 160w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6-24x18.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6-36x27.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6-48x36.jpg 48w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/6.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 269px) 100vw, 269px\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1105\" src=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2-225x300.jpg 225w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2-18x24.jpg 18w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2-27x36.jpg 27w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2-36x48.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></a> <a href=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1104\" src=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1-300x135.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"135\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1-300x135.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1-1024x461.jpg 1024w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1-768x346.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1-24x11.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1-36x16.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1-48x22.jpg 48w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></p>\n<p>አዲስ አበባ | ነሀሴ 27 ቀን 2018 ዓ.ም<br />\nቅዱስ ጴጥሮስ ሆስፒታል ከዘውዲቱ መሸሻ የህፃናትና ቤተሰብ የበጎ አድራጎትና ልማት ማህበር ጋር ባለው ትብብር መሰረት በድርጅቱ የሚገኙ ህፃናትና ሰራተኞችን በመጎብኘት የህክምና አገልግሎትና ድጋፍ ሰጠ፡፡<br />\nየሆስፒታሉ የህክምና ባለሙያዎች በድርጅቱ በአካል በመገኘት ለህፃናቱና ለሰራተኞች የጤና ምርመራ እና የህክምና አገልግሎት አከናውነዋል፡፡ በተጨማሪም የተለያዩ የህክምና ምርመራዎች በማድረግ ከጤና ሁኔታ ጋር በተያያዙ ጉዳዮች ምክርና መመሪያ ሰጥተዋል፡፡<br />\nበዕለቱ የህክምና ቡድኑ የላብራቶሪ ምርመራን ጨምሮ ለህፃናቱ እና ለሰራተኞች አስፈላጊ የሆኑ የጤና ምርመራ አገልግሎቶችን ሰጥተዋል፡፡ ይህም የህፃናቱን ጤና በመከታተል፣ የጤና ችግሮችን ቀድሞ ለመለየትና ተገቢውን የህክምና እርምጃ በወቅቱ ለመውሰድ የሚያግዝ አስፈላጊ ድጋፍ ነው፡፡</p>\n<p>የድርጅቱ መስራች እመበረከት ዘውዲቱ መሸሻም ለህክምና ብድኑ ከዚህ በፊት ላደረጉት አሁንም ላበረከቱት ድጋፍ የምስጋና መልዕክት አስተላልፈው ወደፊትም ድጋፋቸው እንዳይለይ ማሳሰቢያ የሰጡ ሲሆን የህክምና ቡድኑም ድርጅቱ ለሚያደራጀው የመጀመሪያ ህክምና መስጫ የውስጥ ክሊኒክ የተለያዩ የህክምና ግብዓቶችን ለመስጠትና ቅድመ መከላከል ላይ ስልጠና እንደሚያዘጋጁ ቃል በመግባት መልዕክት አስተላልፈዋል፡፡</p>\n<p>ማህበራችን ለቅዱስ ጴጥሮስ ሆስፒታልና ለህክምና ቡድኑ ለህፃናቱና ለሰራተኞች ያደረጉትን የጤና አገልግሎት፣ ትብብርና ድጋፍ የላቀ ምስጋናውን ያቀረበ ሲሆን እንዲህ ዓይነት ትብብሮች የህፃናትን ጤናና ደህንነት ለማረጋገጥ ከፍተኛ ሚና ያላቸው በመሆናቸው በቀጣይም የጋራ ትብብሩ እንዲጠናከር እንደሚሰራ አሳውቋል፡፡</p>\n<p>ለበለጠ መረጃና ድጋፍ ለማድረግ፦</p>\n<p>Websit: https://zewditumeshesha.org/</p>\n<p>Telegram: t.me/+pMFeQ3LZ-WliNmRk</p>\n<p>YouTube: youtube.com/@ZEWDITUASSOCIATION</p>\n<p>TikTok: <a href=\"mailto:tiktok.com/@zewditumesaha\">tiktok.com/@zewditumesaha</a></p>\n<p><strong>“ጤናማ ህፃን፣ ለተሻለ ነገ!”</strong></p>\n<p><strong>ዘውዲቱ መሸሻ የሕፃናትና ቤተሰብ የበጎ አድራጎትና ልማት ማህበር</strong></p>\n",
